<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-News Ltd appoints Eddington to board.</title>
<headline>RTRS-News Ltd appoints Eddington to board.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>News Ltd, the Australian offshoot of global media group News Corp Ltd, said on Wednesday that it had appointed Ansett Australia executive chairman Rod Eddington to its board of directors.</p>
<p>Eddington joined Ansett last month from Hong Kong-based Cathay Pacific Airways where he was managing director.</p>
<p>Ansett is half owned by News Corp and Air New Zealand Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
